{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35868","headline":"和友人喜相遇十首 六 · 李咸用","name":"和友人喜相遇十首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"已向丘门老此躯，可堪空作小人儒。\n吟中景象千般有，书外囊装一物无。\n润屋必能知早散，辉山应是不轻沽。\n短衣宁倦重修谒，谁识高阳旧酒徒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35868.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35868","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}